OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AControversial Orange Order march to go
OL,4,Aahead for first time in nearly 30 years
OL,5,Aafter late night drama
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,8,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,9,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,10,Fhad been given permission to go ahead
OL,11,Falong the Garvaghy Road in Portadown
OL,12,Fwith restrictions in place.
OL,14,FHowever, that decision was challenged
OL,15,Fin several different courts in Belfast
OL,16,Fon Saturday before finally being given
OL,17,Fthe go ahead just hours before the
OL,18,Fparade is due to take place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
